Description: 

 

As claims, I want to create tables and procs to import the weekly recon file received from BCBSM, so that we can have the data parsed and available from these files so that we can match back to a claim and run reconciliation comparisons. 

 

Objectives:

 

We need to deliver the following:

Create the tables to load data
BCBSM_Recon_File
Table will show file load status similar to anthem_recon_file 
BCBSM_Recon_Stage
Table will stage the data from the recon file to load into the detail table
BCBSM_Recon_Detail 
Table will show the loaded recon data from the recon file imported
Create 2 procs to import the files 
proc to clear stage table (clear prev file data prior to import of new)
proc to import file to stage
proc to import to detail table 
Recon File is received WEEKLY
 

Additional Information:

Import proc/process will be set up similarly to what exists for the anthem recon process



recon layout:

BCBSM Recon File Layout.xlsx


